@startuml
title Design phase flow

actor "Product Designer" as Designer
actor "Upstream AI Engine or Agentic Framework(such as TMF780 NaaS API)" as AIEngine
participant "Intent-Based Service Design API" as IntentAPI
participant "Service Catalog & Service Spec" as ServiceCatalog

== UC1: Discovery Process Initiation ==

Designer -> AIEngine : 1 Send Natural Language or Documents
AIEngine -> IntentAPI : 2 Send ResourceFunction (Intent Requirements)

group Pre-condition Check
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 3 Validate Authentication
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 4 Validate ResourceFunction Format
end

IntentAPI -> ServiceCatalog : 5 Query Service Catalog by ResourceFunction
ServiceCatalog --> IntentAPI : 6 Catalog Search Result

alt No Catalog Hit
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 7 Log Unmatched ResourceFunction
else Catalog Hit (Success)
IntentAPI -> ServiceCatalog : 8 Filter CFSSpec/RFSSpec within Scoped Catalog
ServiceCatalog --> IntentAPI : 9 Scoped Specifications
end

== UC2 & UC3: Spec Alignment & Gap Analysis ==

IntentAPI -> ServiceCatalog : 10 Match CFSSpec and RFSSpec (Global/Scoped)
ServiceCatalog --> IntentAPI : 11 Candidate Specs (ID, Version, Metadata)

alt No Spec Hit (Missing Ability)
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 12 Collect unmatched ResourceFunction & Catalog
else Spec Hit (Successful Alignment)
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 13 Extract Matched ServiceSpec (CFS/RFS)
IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 14 Map to Corresponding Service Catalog
end

IntentAPI -> IntentAPI : 15 Aggregate Matched + Unmatched lists into Recommendation Result
IntentAPI --> AIEngine : 16 Return Recommendation (Matched + Unmatched lists)
AIEngine --> Designer : 17 Return Recommendation Result (According to the API Framework)
@enduml
